{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts","id":334307,"title":"[webcomic] Tales of Exalts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-08T10:18:04-08:00","id":334307,"title":"[webcomic] Tales of Exalts","content":"PSA<br /> So as of May the 20th, DA will change into a poorly designed smartphone looking UI mess called Eclipse (knew you couldn't trust those darn smooth talkers).<br /> What this means is that it would be an ABSOLUTE PAIN IN THE ASS, to try and navigate my comic since there would no longer be tabs but instead just ONE GIANT MESS to scroll through (user friendliness at it's finest).<br /> To not have this be a thing, I have now divided my comic into chapter sub-folders that can be found in my &quot;Tales of Exalts&quot; Gallery Folder, there you will find Alchemical report (which since I didn't make it into chapters will sadly just be one giant thing to scroll through, sorry) and all of the chapters as Sub-Folders.<br /> This may actually make things a bit easier for y'all to scroll through hopefully.<br /> Also I wish to say that thank you to that ONE person on DA that actually made a decent job with making it simple to move my pages into sub-folders.<br /> <br /> Tales of Exalts.<br /> <br /> you can find it here: <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a> Chapter 17 Zatzemi Secrets (2020-12-13) One page this week...<br /> <br /> <br /> Ask An Exalt <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/58456085/Ask-An-Exalt\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...5/Ask-An-Exalt</a> 2019-10-27<br /> <br /> Alchemical Report<br /> <br /> this is a story about three champions, the chosen of Autochthon, on a mission to explore a strange new world, Enlightening Arbiter of Justice, the Orichalcum caste, scientist, researcher, scholar and diplomat. Oiled Lightning, the Moonsilver caste, spy, femme fatal, infiltrator and negotiator. Guilt Purging Scourge, the Soulsteel caste. designed for one single thing... to obliterate the anyone that dares to oppose the might of autochthonia,<br /> prepare yourselves for an adventure that will be happening in the same shard as tales of exalts.<br /> you can read it here <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a> enjoy<br /> <br /> NEW PAGE! (2019-08-25) page 119 Was so disappointed with how page 119 turned out that I decided to get back into the main story...<br /> <br /> Tales of Exalts Side Stories.<br /> <br /> these are the stories that are not relevant enough to the main story for it to be included in the main story but are still to important to me to just skip.<br /> <br /> the fall:<span style=\"color:#2C3635\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">this story will tell the tale of how Industrial Heroine and Void Seeking Justicar ended up in the situation they where in, in tales of exalts chapter 2. i will actually make this page purely in lineart with some effect colors, i do this in order to improve my lineworks and ability to draw backgrounds it's a challenge from me to myself, i hope you will enjoy it, P.S. this side story will go to some dark places(and a few really light places) you have been warned.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> REMEMBER! I really encourage you guys and gals that read my stuff to comment, I want to know what you like and what you don't like, cause otherwise there's no way for me to know what I'm doing right or wrong... Also, I love reading peoples thoughts on what I draw. So please, if you enjoy my works then if it's not to much to ask just write a couple of words cause even a short &quot;Nice work&quot; is a huge boost for me!<br /> <br /> FINAL UPDATE! (2016-02-11)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a> (Complete!)<br /> <br /> <br /> (warning the pictures a quite large so they may not be possible to view at phones or they may be slow to load. just wanted to give everyone a heads up. also the beginning of the comic is at the last page in the gallery and there are next, previous and first links at the bottom of each page)<br /> <br /> here is a link to &quot;character profiles&quot; and sketches for some of the different characters that might appear in the comic hope you enjoy (OBSERVE might contain minor spoilers)<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/52318430/character-profiles-and-sketches\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...s-and-sketches</a> NEW SKETCH added (2019-01-20) A sketch of the bodyguards of the speaker of oblivion. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <br /> Commissions.<br /> Here's a link to all the commissions I have done and will do in the future (that I have gotten the all clear from the commissioners to upload that is!)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/gallery/67033365/Commissions\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/g...65/Commissions</a> NEW. Rei of the Silver Tribe.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> the anniversary drawing<br /> today 2016-08-14, It has been two years since i started to work on Tales of Exalts. well now the picture from last year have been updated with 4 of the daughter of the abyss's circle joining the party. Enjoy and WOOOOOOO!<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55761810/the-anniversary-picture\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ersary-picture</a><br /> <br /> <br /> quick description so to say (beware I'm not great at grammar and stuff so a text wall may appear).<br /> <br /> <br /> a blessing turns to a curse.<br /> <br /> the endless dreams of those to strong to die shall end.<br /> <br /> that which consumes even the shadows shall birth forth a herald of an endless night.<br /> <br /> heroes of ancient past born anew shall unite.<br /> <br /> the first among mighty walks creation once more.<br /> <br /> those who know no true emotions shall fell tears and bring forth the rage of five elements united in vengeance.<br /> <br /> the exiled ones shall return home once more.<br /> <br /> as the last rays of light fall upon creation, will the end of days be upon the world? For the Beast that kills the light is born in blood and war and it's hatred is endless as it breaks down the gates of Yu-Shan.<br /> <br /> can four heroes save all of creation?<br /> <br /> can they save each other?<br /> <br /> can they defeat that which even the Unconquered Sun cannot defeat?<br /> <br /> do you want to find out?<br /> <br /> well that's more or less a sort of prophecy intro thingie that i came up with when i made this post (nervous he he) tales of exalts will involve a pretty massive plot and the art style improves with each page so please don't let the first chapter discourage you.<br /> it also involves a few custom things.<br /> <br /> feedback is always appreciated and thank you for reading.<br /> and remember all will be revealed... in time...<br /> <br /> P.S. i usually update at the weekends but i won't promise anything I'm not sure i can keep so it may sometimes be earlier sometimes later depending on if i need to sketch a few characters before introducing them or if other things happen.<br /> Also this comic is a bit mixed sometimes its serious sometimes its more lighthearted and sometimes its more or less an attempt at comedy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":4455,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","user":"Xanroth","date":". 12-13-2020, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T10:57:34-08:00","id":334343,"title":"","content":"Like I said on you DA page, your shading became really good in Chapter 2. The comic looks bad in the beginning, but I can tell that you're developing fast. A few more months of practice and you'll be great. Keep it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T11:03:15-08:00","id":334351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a hre