e/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T09:07:02-08:00","id":340084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=340068#post340068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're definitely improving! The anatomy still feels like it's in odd places at times, but at least I can tell what it's supposed to <i>be</i>.<br /> <br /> My apologies if that sounded like a backhanded compliment - it's more my intention to highlight how rapidly you seem to be improving!<br /> <br /> I'm having difficulty reading the text of your word balloons from time to time - I don't know whether it's my partial colorblindness at work, your choice of color, or my phone's brightness setting being too low. Even so I'm liking the Autochthonia arc, so keep on with this please!</div> </div> </div> </div>thank you very much for the feedback, would you mind maybe telling me what pages are problematic to see just so i know what color combinations to avoid in the future and thank you for the compliment i know my anatomy is strange sometimes but like you said I've been kinda speed rocketing on how i improve (how to draws from my favorite comic au