e opening stages here, so it'll be fun seeing where it goes. Keep it up!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T05:51:38-08:00","id":382989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=382909#post382909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since it pleases me when people comment letting me know they've read and enjoyed my work, let me take a moment to say that I've been enjoying yours.<br /> <br /> I like watching you play with styles, but so far my favorite stuff is the bits of comedy. The end of the most recent chapter, where the guy's orichalcum artifacts just fall out of the sky on him? Pure gold.<br /> <br /> Looks like we've got an interesting long-term plot getting set up in the opening stages here, so it'll be fun seeing where it goes. Keep it up!</div> </div> </div> </div>thank you kindly. just like you it pleases and motivates me greatly when people comment on my work, so i thank you for doing so.<br /> <br /> yup <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> he he i also like working with the comedy parts since the more dramatic and serious parts sometimes makes me feel bad about my poor characters <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> glad you liked that part, at first my plan was to have the water aspect run away and hide in a bush the moment the Alchemical war avatar appeared, later having him jump out of the bushes yelling &quot;I'm alive? I'M ALIVE!&quot; and then have the warstrider fall on him <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, but i found it to be a bit to much set up for just that so instead it was the solar that got hit by artifacts from the sky <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> I'm glad you find the plot set up interesting, i have most of the story planned out and i will keep on making the pages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">h