5/avatar816_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T13:42:52-07:00","id":523675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>leo1925</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=523657#post523657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you give us an explanation (preferably by page number and panel) of who is who in the current scene? Which ones are the deathlords, which ones are abyssals and which ones are neither?</div> </div> </div> </div>page 20<br /> panel 1 and 2 &quot;the chanter of black words&quot; a midnight caste deathknight, servant of the watcher, had his face literally pimp slapped of as punishment for his lack of respect.<br /> soulsteel monsoon, a dusk caste that serves the madman.<br /> &quot;thrice orphaned lady of sorrows&quot;, a daybreak caste, loyal to &quot;the craftsman of genocide&quot; she's the one sitting on monsoons feet.<br /> <br /> sure, page 22 panel 1 left to right,<br /> &quot;the craftsman of genocide&quot;, a deathlord and member of the quadrumvirate.<br /> tall guy is &quot;the soulless watcher in the dark&quot;, deathlord and the leader of the quadrumvirate.<br /> in front of the watcher is &quot;the reaper of the mortal harvest&quot;, a deathlord and member of the quadrumvirate.<br /> and to the right is &quot;the madman of the arena&quot; a very powerful deathlord, a member of the quadrumvirate.<br /> panel 2<br /> in the back with the tetsubo looking grand goremaul, &quot;Gore&quot;, a dusk caste deathknight and servant of 