","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T14:56:19-07:00","id":523725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>leo1925</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=523717#post523717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, and how do the soulsteel monsoon and the &quot;thrice orphaned lady of sorrows&quot; know each other that well? Do those 4 deathlords share a lair or something?</div> </div> </div> </div>they are relatively close to each others bases of operation (except the watcher since he sits in the labyrinth), they have also developed arcane portals that more or less lets them travel to each others bases through the labyrinth. monsoon and lady knows each others from when monsoon exalted, monsoons life was a sad one, being a carmine lily child he was abandoned at birth, somehow he managed to survive and grow up, hated and feared he became a pit fighter, making a pretty good carer, until his rivals ganged up on him and crushed his legs with hammers. now a beggar he spent his time in self pity until the day, she appeared.<br /> for the first time in monsoons life someone did something nice to him, thrice orphaned lady of sorrows saw monsoon felt bad for him and petted him on the head.(yes the nicest thing anyone had done to monsoon was to pat him on the head).<br /> moments later a wyld hunt appeared chasing after lady. lady dispatched half of them with easy but one of them snuk up behind her and tried to fire an elemental bolt at her, using the last of his strength, monsoon threw himself in between the bolt and lady. mortally wounded monsoon heard a voice asking him if he wants to become powerful, if he wants to protect her and destroy everything that wronged him. he agreed. now a dusk caste in service of, the madman, monsoon, trains in the arena with the other two deathknights and on his free time he makes little things for lady to play with (simple straw dolls), because to him lady is the reason he has a life again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T07:18:12-07:00","id":525449,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-5-page-29-534823328\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/Ta...e-29-534823328</a> page 29 of chapter 5 oh dear, she's crazier than an infernal","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-