ntart.com/art/Di...ance-545227494</a><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"color:#2c3635\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> another sketch, dont worry guy's and girls i just need to finish one more then i think i'm ready to start working on the thing i mentioned above, </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2C3635\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">the starmetal colossus known as Diligent Inquisitive Glance, she provides her assembly with logistics, wide area scouting and is the tactical coordinator of the assembly, in battle she provides ranged support with her starmetal gyroscopic chakrams. she have mastered both the thousand wounds gear style and the autochthonian equivalent of the air dragon style. despite her skills as a strategist and tactician most of her plans falls apart when they are up against &quot;the Defiler of the Wastes&quot;.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T07:27:25-07:00","id":586066,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://xanroth.devi