</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T12:57:47-08:00","id":780675,"title":"","content":"No page today, but instead I'm just going to ask y'all for a little bit of help. You see I'm currently trying to sketch out the design for the different champions &quot;combat kits&quot; aka their own personal armors. So far I've done Oiled Lightnings.<br /> right here if you wanna have a look.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://pre12.deviantart.net/007c/th/pre/i/2015/339/e/5/armor_design_sketch_lightning_by_xanroth-d9j49yr.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> Now I'm having some serious trouble coming up with a fitting look for all of the other ones, I will now list the ones that i need some inspiration for as well as what type of weapon and fighting style they use. You see i need the armor to &quot;match&quot; the fighting style so that someone will with a glance know what type of fighter said character is.(any help at all would be very much appreciated and would speed up the comic A LOT! and remember that no idea is a bad one!)<br /> <br /> Void Seeking Justicar, reaper beam-klave and shield. He has a fencing style of fighting meaning that he does a lot of swift stabs not many swings.<br /> <br /> Industrial Heroine. Her fists, that may sometimes be on fire! her fighting style should be that of a brawler, this have not been seen all that much in the comic since her opponent have always been scourge and since scourge is so much larger than heroine, well let's just say that it's hard to make brawling looking moves when the one preforming them is barely half the opponents size.<br /> <br /> Dancing Flames of the Furnace. grimcleaver (her wrench), I'm not really sure what style fits her, considering her choice of weapon and her temper (when she's doesn't panic, her weakness as an anomaly is that she easily panics in certain situations) I will have to go with a slightly reckless fierce style.<br /> <br /> Gears of Progress. Goremaul. He is probably going to have a similar kit as his mentor. He is systematic and efficient when he fights, he does however have difficulty with very agile foes (his anomaly weakness is that he is less flexible than other, his strength however is that he's really, REALLY resilient to damage).<br /> <br /> those are the ones i need some help with, if you have any ideas at all LET ME KNOW!<br /> I will try to make another page tomorrow.<br /> Cya!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T06:22:16-08:00","id":781100,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/The-Fall-page-107-act-four-576473677\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/Th...four-576473677</a> page one hundred and seven of &quot;The Fall, act four&quot; quick quiz, what autochthonian creature breaths smoke, slowly chokes on air and eats metal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.c