4"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T05:07:20-08:00","id":1035169,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-9-page-33-658521057\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/art/Ta...e-33-658521057</a> Page 33 of chapter 9 of ToE.<br /> <br /> What a Twist.<br /> <br /> Also for those who are interested in the lore around stitches and the reapers.<br /> here it is. I may do a short side story going into actual detail about them but until then. This here will have to do.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> the reapers. later known as liminals. are the &quot;revived&quot; chosen of Pluto.<br /> <br /> the reaper of the mortal harvest created the reapers using dark magic learned from the neverborn.<br /> <br /> but he could not create a new kind of exalt even with sorcerous and necromantic workings of the highest power available to a first age solar.<br /> (you need the help of primordials for that. In the ToE universe at least.)<br /> <br /> however his magic did revive and summon one of the forgotten chosen of plutos exaltions.<br /> <br /> at the same time weakening the seal that they had sacrificed themselves and their patron deity to create.<br /> <br /> he did this twelve times before the end of the first age and would later summon his last reaper. Reaper thirteen.<br /> <br /> The reaper had made a plan to weaken creations defenders by causing the great curse infecting the lunars. To &quot;weaken&quot; their exaltions &quot;form&quot;.<br /> <br /> this combined with the exposure to the wyld led to the breaking of the castes and all that jazz.<br /> <br /> he then let himself be found by a party of lunars and &quot;assisted&quot; them by making the moonsilver tattoos. We all saw what that ment last chapter.<br /> <br /> The lunars began exploring his manse which got the reaper worried since he did not want them to find his yet to be brainwashed reaper.<br /> <br /> in desperation he activated number thirteen.<br /> <br /> Thirteen killed him by order of the dark mother and that's that story in a nutshell.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://foru