nroth/gallery/73527136/happy-hero-hunting\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/g...y-hero-hunting</a><br /> It's something for a future project.<br /> If anyone has a character they want drawn then now could be a good time to poke me about it and I may just draw them for you.<br /> <br /> ToE Chapter 17.<br /> <br /> Page 7: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-7-842410218\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...ge-7-842410218</a><br /> <br /> Page 8: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-8-842725017\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...ge-8-842725017</a><br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T03:41:14-07:00","id":1399552,"title":"","content":"I'm alive? I'M ALIVE!!!<br /> <br /> Eeeerm yeah I'm still around sorry about the hiatus there.<br /> Anyway, I wish to talk a little about the future of ToE.<br /> So originally my plan was 10 chapters per act and one act per direction.<br /> This is no longer the case.<br /> I'm just going to try and trudge on and possibly have the completed thing be shorter than my planned 50 chapters (blessed Isles was direction nr5).<br /> This will also mean that I will sometimes have straight up timeskips just to get the story forward in the future because I kinda want to finish this but I also don't want things to end like keychain without a proper ending.<br /> <br /> Now what made me want to end things like this?<br /> Well simply put this comic was started when in the place that i USED to play roleplaying games I played Exalted for the first time.<br /> And it left a permanent mark of joy on me...<br /> However that place no longer exists to me.<br /> It was ruined.<br /> I don't want to point fingers but lets just say that it started to become an effort to even motivate myself to go there.<br /> And with all of the great people that made it a place of joy leaving, I ended up with a bunch of new people that seemed intent on turning it into a hangout they could drink at...<br /> So yeah I left.<br /> The other thing is that there just doesn't seem to be much interest from people to actually read the comic...<br /> Aaaand finally third edition...<br /> Don't get me wrong, I like Third Edition, I enjoy it, however there is a lot of retcons that kinda put wrenches in my work.<br /> Characters disappearing places changing and so on.<br /> <br /> Now I wish to clarify, I'M NOT STOPPING THE COMIC. at least not yet, I will keep up being my stubborn self and try to finish the comic, but just be aware that there may be timeskips and jumps in the future.<br /> That is all.<br /> <br /> Anyway have one single page.<br /> The heat kinda stopped me from making more but still.<br /> <br /> ToE Chapter 17.<br /> <br /> Page 9: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-9-846651384\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...ge-9-846651384</a><br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T00:27:25-07:00","id":1401074,"title":"","content":"So this week we get two pages due to some artist block messing with me on sunday...<br /> Gonna try and get back to three per week this week.<br /> <br /> ToE Chapter 17.<br /> <br /> Page 10: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-10-847206516\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...e-10-847206516</a><br /> <br /> Page 11: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-11-847430879\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...e-11-847430879</a><br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http: