ank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T08:53:21-07:00","id":1402609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=1399552#post1399552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm alive? I'M ALIVE!!!<br /> The other thing is that there just doesn't seem to be much interest from people to actually read the comic...</div> </div> </div> </div>I occasionally read your updates and feel a bit out of the loop. Hosting on Deviant Art makes it a pain to go back and read it all from the beginning. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aaaand finally third edition...<br /> Don't get me wrong, I like Third Edition, I enjoy it, however there is a lot of retcons that kinda put wrenches in my work. Characters disappearing places changing and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Use whatever interpretation of characters and places that fit your stories. Some of your readers have probably never heard of Exalted before, if you cater to them then departures from canon won't matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-19T05:48:09-07:00","id":1403514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/334307-webcomic-tales-of-exalts?p=1402609#post1402609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I occasionally read your updates and feel a bit out of the loop. Hosting on Deviant Art makes it a pain to go back and read it all from the beginning.<br /> <br /> <br /> Use whatever interpretation of characters and places that fit your stories. Some of your readers have probably never heard of Exalted before, if you cater to them then departures from canon won't matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the comment.<br /> It should probably be a little easier now since i organized the comic folder into separate chapters, but yeah DA is not the most optimal place but it's the only one that I have at the moment since all others require me to change size and format on all of my pages.<br /> <br /> Also thanks for saying that, sometimes I know something but still refuse to &quot;acknowledge&quot; it until someone sets me straight so to say.<br /> <br /> anyway, here's two more pages.<br /> <br /> ToE Chapter 17.<br /> <br /> Page 14: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-14-848700990\" target=\"_blank\">https: