ce but it's the only one that I have at the moment since all others require me to change size and format on all of my pages.<br /> <br /> Also thanks for saying that, sometimes I know something but still refuse to &quot;acknowledge&quot; it until someone sets me straight so to say.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been quiet with the critique because whatever issues I have with the formatting limiting my ability to engage, I do respect you for keeping this going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-26T05:30:22-07:00","id":1404754,"title":"","content":"and here we go two more pages.<br /> <br /> I was planning on getting my schedule back on track with three pages a week...<br /> Then I ended up watching warhams and then that was that...<br /> <br /> ToE Chapter 17.<br /> <br /> Page 16: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-16-849436404\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...e-16-849436404</a><br /> <br /> Page 17: <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/art/Tales-of-Exalts-Chapter-17-page-17-849649242\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/xanroth/a...e-17-849649242</a><br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br 